>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>The Madison County judge of probate records Alabama deeds and mortgages.</strong></p><h2>Who records deeds in Madison County</h2><ul><li><a href='https://www.madisoncountyal.gov/departments/probate-judge' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Madison County Judge of Probate</a> records deeds and mortgages.</li></ul><h2>What we confirmed on the official page</h2><ul><li>Recording fees (effective April 1, 2013): imaging $10.00, per page $2.50, filing $1.00, microfilm $0.25, mental health $12.00; total $25.75 first page, $2.50 each additional page</li><li>Deed tax $0.50 per $500 ($1.00 per $1,000) of value/price, minimum $0.50; mortgage tax $0.15 per $100; RT-1 sales validation form must accompany deeds with extra $2.50 page fee; certified copies $1/page plus $2 certification; mailed documents need SASE and 3-inch top margin</li></ul><h2>Fees</h2><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Madison County?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Madison County houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><h2>What we could not confirm</h2><ul><li>Fee table dated 2013; current fees may differ</li></ul><h2>Madison County by the numbers</h2><p>The Census Bureau's 2019-2023 survey counts 397,135 people and 174,709 housing units in Madison County, which ranks 3 of 30 al counties here. Median home value is $267,800, which is 49% above the middle county in this al set. Households here earn a median $83,528; the middle al county is at $60,931. 31% of occupied homes are rented, which leaves 69% owner-occupied.</p><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/alabama-property-tax-guide/'>Alabama Property Tax Guide: Appeals</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/alabama-homestead-exemption/'>Alabama Homestead Exemption Guide</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/alabama-estate-tax/'>Alabama Estate and Inheritance Tax</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-alabama/'>We buy houses in Alabama</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://www.madisoncountyal.gov/departments/probate-judge' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Madison County Judge of Probate</a></li><li><a href='https://www.revenue.alabama.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Alabama Department of Revenue</a></li><li><a href='https://alison.legislature.state.al.us/code-of-alabama' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Code of Alabama</a></li></ul><p><em>This is general information about Madison County, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"p