 of Probate offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling in Jefferson County? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy Jefferson County houses as-is and reply with a written cash offer.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>The Jefferson County judge of probate records Alabama deeds and mortgages.</strong></p><h2>Who records deeds in Jefferson County</h2><ul><li><a href='https://jeffcoprobatecourt.com/recording/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Probate Court of Jefferson County</a> records deeds and mortgages.</li></ul><h2>What we confirmed on the official page</h2><ul><li>Recording fees (effective 6/1/2012): $16.00 first page plus $3.00 each additional page; $1.00 &#x27;No Tax Collected&#x27; stamp; $1.00 per additional grantee/grantor beyond 2 each; Deed tax $0.50 per $500; Mortgage tax $0.15 per $100</li><li>Satisfaction of mortgage $16.00 regardless of pages; maps $28.00 standard</li><li>Birmingham Division: Jefferson County Courthouse, 716 North Richard Arrington Jr. Blvd., Birmingham, AL 35203; Bessemer Division: 1801 3rd Avenue North, Bessemer, AL 35020 (from the county site listing; confirm with the office)</li><li>Jefferson County Probate Office offers eRecording (from the county site listing; confirm with the office)</li></ul><h2>Fees</h2><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div st